# Roaming Throne: "As this creature enters, choose a creature type" (Wizard), "This creature is the chosen type in
# addition to its other types" (a Golem Wizard), and "If a triggered ability of another creature you control of the
# chosen type triggers, it triggers an additional time" (CR 603.2d). With Naban, Dean of Iteration beside it, Emry, Lurker
# of the Loch - a Wizard creature Bot1 controls, entering - triggers its "mill four cards" three times: once, once more
# for Naban (a Wizard you control entering) and once more for the Throne (an ability of another Wizard you control). Bot1
# mills twelve.
# Mana: turn 1 Black Lotus (UUU) and Mox Jet pay the Throne's {4}, Mox Sapphire and the Island Naban's {1}{U}. Turn 3 Emry
# costs {2}{U} less {3} for the Throne and two Moxen: {U}, the second Island.

